#: ../../tools/col_tools.rst:32 71bba4c913fb4c0c9a3e2f3e4a29e613
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get child taxa (immediate subtaxa) of a given taxon in "
"the Catalogue of Life. For example, get all species within a genus, or "
"all genera within a family. Uses the parentId parameter to list direct "
"descendants. Returns child taxon names, ranks, IDs, and status. Use "
"CoL\\_search\\_species or CoL\\_get\\_taxon to find the parent taxon ID "
"first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/col_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/col_tools.rst:71
#: ../../tools/col_tools.rst:102 37eea0068f2f4bd19d3fb0e98e36c7bd
#: 4473591e437d43e3919c8ed8539abd7a dee079ca9ae64e9282a870a923f3c4a4
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/col_tools.rst:36 3c6931296edb4b2ca5ae010e36cd0da4
msgid ""
"``parentId`` (string) (required) CoL ID of the parent taxon whose "
"children to retrieve (e.g., '636X2' for genus Homo, '623RM' for family "
"Felidae). Obtain from CoL\\_search\\_species or CoL\\_get\\_taxon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/col_tools.rst:39 67b36c6b01114e41ab9a6e0fa4ad3b86
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer, null) (optional) Maximum number of children to return"
" (default 10, max 1000)"
msgstr ""

